{"id":"2750dda190a51fda","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-priestley-dual.md","title":"Priestley Dual","display":"Priestley Dual","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-priestley-dual","aliases":["93-lem-priestley-dual"],"display":"Priestley Dual","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-priestley-dual]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-priestley-dual"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-priestley-dual</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Priestley Dual"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"18e84a8354274052\" href=\"?note=18e84a8354274052\" title=\"93-df-priestley-dual\">93-df-priestley-dual</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-priestley-dual---Priestley-Dual\">lem-priestley-dual - Priestley Dual</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf L=\\langle L,\\wedge,\\vee,0,1\\rangle\">\\(\\mathbf L=\\langle L,\\wedge,\\vee,0,1\\rangle\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}\\)</span> is the predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0454a0272a142daa\" href=\"?note=0454a0272a142daa\" title=\"93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice\">93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\mathbf L}\">\\(X_{\\mathbf L}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf L}\">\\(\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf L}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq_{\\mathbf L}\">\\(\\preceq_{\\mathbf L}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrSpace}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrSpace}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClopUpAlg}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClopUpAlg}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_{\\mathbf L}\">\\(\\eta_{\\mathbf L}\\)</span> are the exact constructions of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"18e84a8354274052\" href=\"?note=18e84a8354274052\" title=\"93-df-priestley-dual\">93-df-priestley-dual</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BDLIso}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{BDLIso}_{93}\\)</span> is the bounded-distributive-lattice isomorphism predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"18e84a8354274052\" href=\"?note=18e84a8354274052\" title=\"93-df-priestley-dual\">93-df-priestley-dual</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}priestley\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\to{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PrSpace}_{93}(X_{\\mathbf L},\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf L},\\preceq_{\\mathbf L})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{BDLIso}_{93}\\!\\left(\n\\eta_{\\mathbf L},\\mathbf L,\n\\mathrm{ClopUpAlg}_{93}(X_{\\mathbf L},\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf L},\\preceq_{\\mathbf L})\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}priestley\\text{-}dual}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}(\\mathbf L)\\to{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PrSpace}_{93}(X_{\\mathbf L},\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf L},\\preceq_{\\mathbf L})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{BDLIso}_{93}\\!\\left(\n\\eta_{\\mathbf L},\\mathbf L,\n\\mathrm{ClopUpAlg}_{93}(X_{\\mathbf L},\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf L},\\preceq_{\\mathbf L})\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The canonical prime-filter construction supplies both the Priestley separation property and a correctly typed bounded-lattice isomorphism; neither is left as prose.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-priestley-dual---Priestley-Dual","text":"lem-priestley-dual - Priestley Dual","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-priestley-dual","status":"resolved","id":"18e84a8354274052","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-priestley-dual]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"0454a0272a142daa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf L=\\langle L,\\wedge,\\vee,0,1\\rangle$ and $\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}$ is the predicate of [[93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-priestley-dual","status":"resolved","id":"18e84a8354274052","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X_{\\mathbf L}$, $\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf L}$, $\\preceq_{\\mathbf L}$, $\\mathrm{PrSpace}_{93}$, $\\mathrm{ClopUpAlg}_{93}$, and $\\eta_{\\mathbf L}$ are the exact constructions of [[93-df-priestley-dual]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-priestley-dual","status":"resolved","id":"18e84a8354274052","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BDLIso}_{93}$ is the bounded-distributive-lattice isomorphism predicate of [[93-df-priestley-dual]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf L=\\langle L,\\wedge,\\vee,0,1\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"X_{\\mathbf L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_{\\mathbf L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\preceq_{\\mathbf L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrSpace}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClopUpAlg}_